---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="Terms of Service | Holiday Gift Hub"
  description="Terms and conditions of using Holiday Gift Hub website and resources."
>
  <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 py-14">
    <h1 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-black text-slate-900 mb-6">Terms of Service</h1>
    <p class="text-xs text-slate-500 mb-8">Last updated: October 22, 2026</p>

    <div class="space-y-6 text-sm text-slate-700 leading-relaxed">
      <section>
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-900 mb-2">1. Acceptance of Terms</h2>
        <p>
          By accessing and using Holiday Gift Hub, you agree to comply with and be bound by these Terms of Service. If you do not agree to these terms, please do not use this site.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-900 mb-2">2. Free Printable Resources License</h2>
        <p>
          All printable PDFs and party games provided on Holiday Gift Hub are for personal, non-commercial, and classroom/office use only. You may download and print copies for your holiday gatherings. You may not resell, redistribute, or rehost our PDFs on other platforms for commercial gain.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-900 mb-2">3. Accuracy of Product Information and Prices</h2>
        <p>
          Product prices, ratings, and shipping availability on Amazon fluctuate constantly. While we make every effort to display accurate price ranges, the final purchase price and shipping terms are determined on the third-party merchant's platform at the time of checkout.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-900 mb-2">4. Limitation of Liability</h2>
        <p>
          Holiday Gift Hub and its editorial team shall not be liable for any damages arising out of the use or inability to use the materials, printables, or recommended products listed on this site.
        </p>
      </section>
    </div>
  </div>
</Layout>
